.TH PLASMA-VISUAL-SCREENSAVER 1 "August 2026" "plasma-visual-screensaver @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
plasma-visual-screensaver \- non-locking visual screensaver for Plasma Wayland
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B plasma-visual-screensaver
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B plasma-visual-screensaver
provides configurable visual overlays after user inactivity on KDE Plasma
Wayland. It is decorative software, not a screen locker or security boundary.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version information.
.TP
.B \-\-background
Run only as a background idle service.
.TP
.B \-\-preview
Show the screensaver immediately.
.TP
.B \-\-settings
Open the settings window.
.TP
.B \-\-quit
Stop the running background process.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/plasma-visual-screensaverrc
Per-user settings managed through KDE's configuration system.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemsettings (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
<https://github.com/StantonMatt/plasma-wayland-screensaver/issues>.
